<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NewStart Resource Finder</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <p class="brand">NewStart</p>
        <h1>Support for your first steps in Toronto</h1>
        <p>Find official newcomer services based on your needs, language, and area.</p>
    </header>
    <main>
        <p class="step-label">PERSONALIZED RESOURCE FINDER</p>
        <h2>What can we help you find today?</h2>
        <p>NewStart provides <%= resourceCount %> City of Toronto newcomer-service records you can browse or search.</p>
        <p class="notice">This is an information finder, not immigration or legal advice. Confirm current eligibility and availability with each organization.</p>
        <div class="action-links">
            <a class="button-link" href="/search">Find resources for me</a>
            <a class="button-link secondary-link" href="/resources">Browse all resources</a>
        </div>
        <p class="source-note">Data source: City of Toronto Open Data, stored locally as JSON.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
